      },
      "_comment_autoIncrement": "REMOVED deliberately. With appVersionSource:'local', autoIncrement made EAS bump android.versionCode / ios.buildNumber in app.json AT BUILD TIME and write the file back — so a commit made before the build was always stale by one, and the tag never matched the artifact in the store. app.json is now the single source of truth: bump version, versionCode and buildNumber by hand (see CLAUDE.md 'Release / deploy flow'), commit, then build. The cost is that a rebuild after a failed upload needs a manual bump, which fails loudly at the store rather than silently shipping a mismatched number.",
      "env": {
        "EXPO_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL": "https://api.kaata.af",
        "EXPO_PUBLIC_SOLO_STORE_MODE": "1",
        "EXPO_PUBLIC_DISTRIBUTION": "store",
        "EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_IOS_CLIENT_ID": "987359341353-dgceg8n94aem9pgorclo11l4nr5906i8.apps.googleusercontent.com"
      }
    }
